points.text:
Any four from:

 isomer 1 : octahedral Co with H2O top, H2O bottom, Cl upper left, Br lower left, bidentate O-O ligand on right ;

 isomer 2 : octahedral Co with Cl top, H2O middle left, H2O lower left, Br bottom, bidentate O-O ligand on right ;

 isomer 3 : octahedral Co with Cl top, H2O middle left, Br lower left, H2O bottom, bidentate O-O ligand on right ;

 isomer 4 : octahedral Co with Br top, H2O middle left, Cl lower left, H2O bottom, bidentate O-O ligand on right ;

 isomer 5 : octahedral Co with H2O top, H2O middle left, Cl lower left, Br bottom, bidentate O-O ligand on right ;

 isomer 6 : octahedral Co with H2O top, H2O middle left, Br lower left, Cl bottom, bidentate O-O ligand on right

Any two [1], any three [2], all four [3]
